728<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><span class=\"smx-float a\"><span class=\"hh\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 21s-7-4.35-9.5-8.5C.5 9 2 5.5 5.5 5.5c2 0 3.2 1.2 3.9 2.3.7-1.1 1.9-2.3 3.9-2.3C16.8 5.5 18.3 9 16.5 12.5 14 16.65 12 21 12 21z\"\/><\/svg><\/span> 2.4k<\/span><span class=\"smx-float b\"><span class=\"cc\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M4 4h16a2 2 0 012 2v9a2 2 0 01-2 2H9l-5 4V6a2 2 0 012-2z\"\/><\/svg><\/span> 180<\/span><span class=\"smx-float c\"><span class=\"vv\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M6 4l14 8-14 8z\"\/><\/svg><\/span> 45k views<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/section>\n<div class=\"smx-marq\">\n<div class=\"tr\">Instagram Growth <b>\u2022<\/b> Reels &#038; UGC <b>\u2022<\/b> Meta Ads <b>\u2022<\/b> Community <b>\u2022<\/b> Influencer Collabs <b>\u2022<\/b> Analytics <b>\u2022<\/b> Instagram Growth <b>\u2022<\/b> Reels &#038; UGC <b>\u2022<\/b> Meta Ads <b>\u2022<\/b> Community <b>\u2022<\/b> Influencer Collabs <b>\u2022<\/b> Analytics <b>\u2022<\/b> <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"smx-wrap\" id=\"smx-work\">\n<section class=\"smx-sec smx-rev\">\n<h2 class=\"smx-h2\">A full <span>creator studio<\/span>, in one team.<\/h2>\n<p class=\"smx-sub\">Strategy, content, ads and community &#8211; the complete social system that grows reach and revenue for Goa brands.<\/p>\n<div class=\"smx-bento\">\n<div class=\"smx-tile big smx-rev\"><span class=\"big-badge\">Most popular<\/span><\/p>\n<div class=\"ic\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"\/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"\/><\/svg><\/div>\n<div>\n<h3>Paid Social Advertising<\/h3>\n<p>High-ROI Instagram &amp; Facebook campaigns with precise targeting, creative testing and conversion tracking that turn ad spend into measurable bookings and sales.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"smx-tile tall smx-rev\">\n<div class=\"ic\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M11 4H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2v-7\"\/><path d=\"M18.5 2.5a2.1 2.1 0 013 3L12 15l-4 1 1-4z\"\/><\/svg><\/div>\n<h3>Content Creation<\/h3>\n<p>Reels, posts, stories &amp; graphics designed to stop the scroll.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"smx-tile smx-rev\">\n<div class=\"ic\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 3v18h18\"\/><path d=\"M7 14l3-3 3 3 5-6\"\/><\/svg><\/div>\n<h3>Strategy &amp; Audit<\/h3>\n<p>A data-backed plan tuned to your niche.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"smx-tile smx-rev\">\n<div class=\"ic\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M4 4h16a2 2 0 012 2v9a2 2 0 01-2 2H9l-5 4V6a2 2 0 012-2z\"\/><\/svg><\/div>\n<h3>Community<\/h3>\n<p>On-brand engagement that builds loyalty.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"smx-tile wide smx-rev\">\n<div class=\"ic\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"4\"\/><path d=\"M4 21c0-4 4-6 8-6s8 2 8 6\"\/><\/svg><\/div>\n<h3>Influencer &amp; Creator Collaborations<\/h3>\n<p>Authentic partnerships with Goa creators that expand reach and trust.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"smx-tile smx-rev\">\n<div class=\"ic\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 3v18h18\"\/><path d=\"M7 14l3-3 3 3 5-6\"\/><\/svg><\/div>\n<h3>Analytics<\/h3>\n<p>Reporting on the metrics that grow revenue.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/section>\n<section class=\"smx-metrics smx-rev\">\n<div><b>14+<\/b><span>Years growing Goa brands<\/span><\/div>\n<div><b>500+<\/b><span>Campaigns delivered<\/span><\/div>\n<div><b>30+<\/b><span>Creators in our network<\/span><\/div>\n<div><b>100%<\/b><span>In-house, no outsourcing<\/span><\/div>\n<\/section>\n<section class=\"smx-sec smx-rev\">\n<h2 class=\"smx-h2\">How we <span>grow your account<\/span><\/h2>\n<div class=\"smx-time\">\n<div class=\"smx-tstep smx-rev\"><span class=\"n\">1<\/span><\/p>\n<h4>Discover<\/h4>\n<p>We audit your presence, competitors and audience, then define clear goals.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"smx-tstep smx-rev\"><span class=\"n\">2<\/span><\/p>\n<h4>Plan<\/h4>\n<p>A monthly content calendar and paid-social roadmap mapped to those goals.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"smx-tstep smx-rev\"><span class=\"n\">3<\/span><\/p>\n<h4>Create &#038; Launch<\/h4>\n<p>Our studio produces content and launches optimized campaigns.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"smx-tstep smx-rev\"><span class=\"n\">4<\/span><\/p>\n<h4>Optimize &#038; Scale<\/h4>\n<p>We test relentlessly and scale what drives leads, bookings and sales.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/section>\n<section class=\"smx-sec smx-rev\">\n<h2 class=\"smx-h2\">Questions, <span>answered<\/span><\/h2>\n<div class=\"smx-faq\">\n<div class=\"smx-q\"><button type=\"button\">How much does social media marketing cost in Goa?<span class=\"qi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"\/><\/svg><\/span><\/button><\/p>\n<div class=\"smx-aa\">\n<p>Pricing depends on platforms, content volume and ad spend. We offer flexible monthly retainers scaled to your goals and budget.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"smx-q\"><button type=\"button\">Which platforms are best for my business?<span class=\"qi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"\/><\/svg><\/span><\/button><\/p>\n<div class=\"smx-aa\">\n<p>For most Goa businesses Instagram and Facebook drive the strongest results, with LinkedIn for B2B and YouTube for video. We recommend the mix based on your audience.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"smx-q\"><button type=\"button\">Do you create the content too?<span class=\"qi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"\/><\/svg><\/span><\/button><\/p>\n<div class=\"smx-aa\">\n<p>Yes &#8211; reels, posts, stories, graphics and captions are handled end-to-end by our in-house creative team.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"smx-q\"><button type=\"button\">How soon will I see results?<span class=\"qi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"\/><\/svg><\/span><\/button><\/p>\n<div class=\"smx-aa\">\n<p>Engagement and reach improve within the first few weeks; paid campaigns can drive leads almost immediately, while organic growth compounds over months.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/section>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"smx-wrap\">\n<section class=\"smx-cta-band smx-rev\">\n<h2>Let\u2019s make your brand impossible to scroll past.<\/h2>\n<p>Book a free strategy call and get a custom social media plan for your Goa business.<\/p>\n<div class=\"smx-cta\"><a class=\"smx-btn p\" href=\"https:\/\/www.sanctify.in\/contact\/\">Get a Free Proposal<\/a><a class=\"smx-btn g\" href=\"https:\/\/www.sanctify.in\/sanctify-facility\/\">View All Services<\/a><\/div>\n<p class=\"mini\">Related: <a href=\"https:\/\/www.sanctify.in\/sanctify-facility\/influencer-marketing-agency-goa\/\">Influencer Marketing<\/a> \u00b7 <a href=\"https:\/\/www.sanctify.in\/sanctify-facility\/ppc-google-ads-agency-goa\/\">PPC &amp; Google Ads<\/a> \u00b7 <a href=\"https:\/\/www.sanctify.in\/sanctify-facility\/content-marketing-agency-goa\/\">Content Marketing<\/a><\/p>\n<\/section>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Social Media Marketing \u00b7 Goa Make Goa stop scrolling and start buying. We turn feeds into funnels. Sanctify runs strategy, scroll-stopping content, paid social and community management across Instagram, Facebook, YouTube &amp; LinkedIn &#8211; built for Goa audiences and measured on real results. Get a&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":6,"featured_media":0,"parent":2861,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_seopress_robots_primary_cat":"","_seopress_titles_title":"Social Media Marketing Agency in Goa | Sanctify","_seopress_titles_desc":"Grow your brand with Sanctify, a results-driven social media marketing agency in Goa. Instagram, Facebook & LinkedIn strategy, content, ads & community management.","_seopress_robots_index":"","footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-6977","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.sanctify.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/6977","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.sanctify.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.sanctify.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.sanctify.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/6"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.sanctify.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=6977"}],"version-history":[{"count":3,"href":"https:\/\/www.sanctify.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/6977\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":6995,"href":"https:\/\/www.sanctify.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/6977\/revisions\/6995"}],"up":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.sanctify.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/2861"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.sanctify.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=6977"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}